      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "caption": "A method_id is three indexes: class type, prototype and name string.",
      "narration": "A method_id is just three indexes: a type for the class, a proto for the signature, and a string for the name. Types are descriptors like Ljava/lang/String.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "Resolving a method",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 5,
          "w": 84,
